    "detailed_description": "Project Description:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn this expansive VR Military Simulation, Players will team up against unrelenting A.I. opponents to complete Objective-based Missions using Combined Arms assets on land, in the sea, and the skies above.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDevelop your expertise in many different and challenging roles, and use your specialized skills to help your coalition achieve the mission objective! &quot;Team-work makes the Dream work!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMission objections include<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNaval Combat: ASW/ASuW (Anti Surface Warfare/ Anti Sub Warfare)<br />\r\nCAS Close Air Support via AC-130U/A-10Warthog/EA-6B Prowler<br />\r\nCAP Combat Air Patrol F-14D Tomcat<br />\r\nMultirole Air-Support C-130U/UH-60<br />\r\nGround Support M1-A2 Abrams/HUMVEE<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd many more...<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKindly note that it will start in Beta stage, where most vehicles will be in rudimentary functionality and hopefully with time it will get further development.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis sim is being build by a single developer, I apologize for any bugs or inconvenience and would appreciate your patience and support.",
